# The build context is what can END UP IN AN IMAGE. assets/docs stays out
# first and foremost: it holds documentation screenshots, some of which
# are gitignored precisely because they must never be published -- an
# image is a form of publishing. The rest of the repository stays IN the
# context on purpose: the test stage runs the whole suite, and the suite
# reads assets/brand, docs/, .github/ and web/src as fixtures.
assets/docs
.git
.claude
Testing
dist
build
*.egg-info
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
web/node_modules
web/dist
server/static
